  "body": "\"Remove unused CSS\" is an optimization message that is valid for Web 1.0 and Web 2.0 requests, not Web 3.0 requests. The CSS must be loaded initially for all pages unless it can be loaded per-page. The standard and browser implementation _must come first_ before we can actually utilize it! Until then \"Remove unused CSS\" remains absolutely invalid for Web 3.0 websites.",
